{
  "$comment": [
    "Source art for assets/sprites/characters.png. Run `npm run build:sprites` after editing.",
    "Ported from docs/design/character-sprite-bible.html. Every layer is a whole 16 x 24 frame,",
    "one palette character per pixel, with the body starting on frame row 8. A row may be",
    "prefixed with `N*` to repeat it N times. Palette character `0` is transparent.",
    "s S T, h H G and C c d are key colours the renderer swaps for skin, hair and tunic.",
    "7 8 9 and R W Y F are a hat's ramp and accents, swapped per hat; 1 to 6 are a cloak's palette,",
    "swapped per cloak. The bible's hat 1 2 3 r w y f are 7 8 9 R W Y F here.",
    "Seated, attack and downed layers are authored here too (#313); the downed ones are 24 x 16.",
    "See assets/sprites/README.md."
